title: $:/language/hypergsd/Lists/

# Contacts additions to the shared Lists string namespace. The contact view
# body reuses the main plugin's action-list headings and toggles. Remove/HintA
# and Remove/HintB sandwich the contact title in the entry's × tooltip (the
# CreateAdd two-string pattern).
Contacts: Contact list
NextByContact: Next actions by contact
WaitingByContact: Waiting actions by contact
FutureByContact: Future actions by contact
GroupBy/contact: Contacts
ContactFilter: Actions by contact
ContactFilter/Filter: Filter by contacts:
ContactFilter/Choose: -- pick a contact --
ContactFilter/Remove/HintA: Remove contact
ContactFilter/Remove/HintB: from search